{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"gh issue view 45 --repo mrkkucharski/vgt --json title,body,labels,comments,state && rg -n -i 'Lalal|LALAL|review|idempotency|minutes_left|check/' . --glob '\"'!*.lock'\"' --glob '\"'!*.mp3'\"'\"","aggregated_output":"{\"body\":\"Implement the only network-touching piece: the LALAL.AI **API v1** backend behind the `Separator` seam. See **[docs/stem-separation-plan.md](../blob/main/docs/stem-separation-plan.md)** — sub-issue **B**, §1 (API v1), and Acceptance criteria (§5).\\n\\n**Depends on #43 (operation model + seam) and #44 (final paths).** Do not start until both are closed.\\n\\n## Scope — v1 endpoints\\n- Auth header `X-License-Key` from **`LALAL_LICENSE_KEY`**, never persisted or logged. (v0 `Authorization: license …` is deprecated — not used.)\\n- `POST /api/v1/upload/` → `POST /api/v1/split/stem_separator/` → poll `POST /api/v1/check/` (task_ids) → download; plus `/api/v1/limits/minutes_left/`, `/api/v1/cancel/`, `/api/v1/delete/`.\\n- **Do not** use `/api/v1/split/multistem/` — per-stem-minute billing gives no saving and one-task-many-outputs would break per-operation resume (see plan §1).\\n- Presets: `splitter` (default `auto`), `dereverb_enabled`, `extraction_level`, fixed `encoder_format=\\\"wav\\\"`. (There is **no** `enhanced_processing_enabled` in v1.)\\n\\n## Recipe (five paid operations, each reference stem from the ORIGINAL)\\nupload original → vocals [keep stem + instrumental] → bass/drums/guitar from original [keep stems] → upload instrumental → guitar [keep back = `backing`]. The final guitar op is the **only** cascade.\\n\\n## Must-have durability\\n- Generate + persist a UUID **`idempotency_key`** before submission; persist task id immediately on success; on restart resume a known task. Ambiguous submission whose task identity can't be recovered **fails closed** (no auto-retry, no second charge).\\n- Pre-flight `minutes_left` vs sum of outstanding operation durations (vocal pair counts once); a run that can't cover the outstanding recipe starts **no** new paid tasks.\\n- Poll < 30 req/min with bounded backoff; handle `429`, task errors, cancellation, upload/task expiry, expired download URLs; re-upload only expired sources.\\n- Stream downloads to `.part`, validate length + readable WAV metadata/plausible duration, atomic rename, store SHA-256/size/duration. Partial files never treated as cached. Record requested **and** effective presets (incl. the model `auto` chose; pin it on a reconstruction retry).\\n\\n## Tests\\n- Mock v1 HTTP fixtures in CI (**no live calls**); assert `X-License-Key` redacted from exceptions/progress/sidecars/snapshots. One explicitly manual, opt-in smoke test for an account owner before release.\",\"comments\":[{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOTcQqas8AAAABK2DIWg\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mrkkucharski\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Dependency check: #43 is closed, but #44 is still open. Per this issue’s explicit instruction not to start until both dependencies are closed, no implementation work has been started. I am leaving the status unchanged; this is dependency ordering, not a human/external blocker.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-20T13:22:36Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mrkkucharski/vgt/issues/45#issuecomment-5022730330\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOTcQqas8AAAABK2jhnQ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mrkkucharski\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Implemented and pushed LALAL API v1 backend (commits 68ceb76, 28794f7). Includes v1 upload/split/check/limits/cancel/delete, durable source/task/idempotency checkpoints with fail-closed ambiguity handling, bounded polling and WAV download validation, effective-model pinning, mocked HTTP tests, and an opt-in manual smoke-test procedure. Verified: 55 backend/project tests and 19 analysis tests pass (3 pre-existing Python deprecation warnings).\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-20T14:16:25Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mrkkucharski/vgt/issues/45#issuecomment-5023261085\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true}],\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOTcQqas8AAAACsQEnfA\",\"name\":\"status:working\",\"description\":\"\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOTcQqas8AAAACsQEoHw\",\"name\":\"implementer:codex\",\"description\":\"\",\"color\":\"0052cc\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOTcQqas8AAAACsQEoaQ\",\"name\":\"reviewer:codex\",\"description\":\"\",\"color\":\"006b75\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOTcQqas8AAAACsQEo6Q\",\"name\":\"priority:medium\",\"description\":\"\",\"color\":\"fbca04\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOTcQqas8AAAACsRhqXA\",\"name\":\"fix-count:1\",\"description\":\"\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"}],\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"M1-B: LALAL API v1 backend (LalalSeparator)\"}\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:1:\"\"\"LALAL.AI API v1 implementation of the :class:`vgt.separation.Separator` seam.\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:24:class LalalError(RuntimeError):\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:25:    \"\"\"A safe-to-display LALAL API failure (never includes credentials).\"\"\"\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:28:class AmbiguousSubmissionError(LalalError):\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:36:class InsufficientMinutesError(LalalError):\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:40:class LalalSeparator:\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:41:    \"\"\"Network-only LALAL API v1 separator.\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:45:    The license key is read only from ``LALAL_LICENSE_KEY`` and is retained in\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:49:    name = \"lalal\"\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:51:    base_url = \"https://www.lalal.ai\"\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:62:        key = license_key if license_key is not None else os.environ.get(\"LALAL_LICENSE_KEY\")\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:64:            raise LalalError(\"LALAL_LICENSE_KEY is required for LALAL API v1 separation\")\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:72:    def __enter__(self) -> \"LalalSeparator\":\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:88:            raise LalalError(f\"LALAL API request failed: {self._redact(exc)}\") from exc\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:91:            raise LalalError(f\"LALAL API {method} {path} returned HTTP {response.status_code}\")\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:107:            # This is only an early safety estimate.  LALAL's upload duration\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:115:        again against LALAL's authoritative upload duration before submission.\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:117:        minutes_left = float(self._request(\"POST\", \"/api/v1/limits/minutes_left/\").json()[\"minutes_left\"])\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:119:        if needed and minutes_left < needed:\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:121:                f\"LALAL has {minutes_left:.2f} minutes left but this run needs {needed:.2f}; no tasks were submitted\"\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:134:            raise LalalError(f\"LALAL upload failed: {self._redact(exc)}\") from exc\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:136:            raise LalalError(f\"LALAL upload returned HTTP {response.status_code}\")\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:145:            raise LalalError(\"LALAL upload response was missing source identity\") from exc\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:156:        state[\"idempotency_key\"] = state.get(\"idempotency_key\") or str(uuid.uuid4())\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:161:        # LALAL's ``auto`` mode. That avoids making a mismatched vocal/back\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:170:            \"idempotency_key\": state[\"idempotency_key\"],\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:183:                \"LALAL split submission outcome is unknown; task was not retried to avoid a second charge\"\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:187:                f\"LALAL split submission returned HTTP {response.status_code}; task was not retried to avoid a second charge\"\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:193:                \"LALAL accepted split submission without a task id; task was not retried to avoid a second charge\"\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:198:        response = self._request(\"POST\", \"/api/v1/check/\", json={\"task_ids\": [task_id]})\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:202:            raise LalalError(\"LALAL check response did not contain the submitted task\") from exc\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:209:            except LalalError as exc:\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:224:                raise LalalError(f\"LALAL task {status}: {self._redact(result.get('error', 'no details'))}\")\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:226:                raise LalalError(f\"LALAL task returned unknown status {status!r}\")\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:235:                    return False  # signed URL expired; caller refreshes via /check/\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:237:                    raise LalalError(f\"LALAL download returned HTTP {response.status_code}\")\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:245:                raise LalalError(\"LALAL download length did not match Content-Length\")\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:249:                        raise LalalError(\"LALAL download has no readable WAV audio\")\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:251:                raise LalalError(\"LALAL download is not a readable WAV file\") from exc\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:255:            raise LalalError(f\"LALAL download failed: {self._redact(exc)}\") from exc\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:273:                \"Previous LALAL submission has no recorded task id; refusing automatic retry to avoid a second charge\"\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:284:                raise LalalError(f\"LALAL completed task without required {side} track\")\n./src/vgt/lalal.py:291:                    raise LalalError(\"LALAL download URL expired and could not be refreshed\")\n./src/vgt/sidecar.py:30:           \"backend\": str | null,             # e.g. \"fake\", \"lalal\"\n./AGENTS.md:15:by the orchestrator (when starting, reviewing, or fixing work) and by you (when\n./AGENTS.md:22:| `status:ready-for-review` | Implementation complete, waiting for a reviewer | Implementer agent |\n./AGENTS.md:23:| `status:needs-fix` | Reviewer rejected it; implementer must fix | Reviewer agent |\n./AGENTS.md:28:1. **When you finish and mark ready-for-review:** remove `status:working`.\n./AGENTS.md:30:   gh issue edit <N> --repo <repo> --add-label status:ready-for-review --remove-label status: